&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Graphics Engineer. &lt;/strong&gt;This role can be based &lt;strong&gt;remotely&lt;/strong&gt; in the UK, Ireland, Portugal, Spain or from our &lt;strong&gt;Barcelona&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;hub on a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid basis&lt;/strong&gt;. If you&#39;re open to working in any of these locations, there&#39;s no need to apply more than once. We&#39;ll discuss location preferences during the hiring process. We can support with visa sponsorship from any location. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for strong rendering expertise and a passion for delivering high-quality, high-performance visuals. You will work on real-time rendering features and optimizations that help our game look and run its best across a wide range of devices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are in the early stages of development on an ambitious, unannounced, cross-platform Strategy/MMO title, creating a team of talented and passionate game makers to join us on this exciting journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day — whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and optimize real-time rendering features on mobile platforms using Vulkan (Android) and Metal (iOS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with clustered/meshlet-based geometry systems, implementing GPU-driven visibility, culling, and LOD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate and refine modern rendering techniques such as clustered/tiled lighting, temporal anti-aliasing (TAA), and super-resolution (TSR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist in the development of real-time global illumination features in collaboration with senior technical staff, ensuring scalability across different device tiers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write and optimize shaders (HLSL/GLSL/MSL) for power-efficient mobile performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profile GPU/CPU performance and analyze rendering bottlenecks using tools like RenderDoc, Perfetto, Xcode GPU Debugger, and Mali/Snapdragon profilers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to GPU memory layout design, draw submission strategies, and render pass optimizations for tile-based GPUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with engine and content teams to ensure visuals meet quality and performance goals across platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay informed on industry rendering trends and suggest improvements to our pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of graphics programming experience, with a focus on mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong C++ skills with experience working in performance-critical rendering code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid knowledge of Vulkan and/or Metal APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Unity’s Scriptable Render Pipeline (SRP), including extending or customizing SRPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of mobile GPU architecture (tiling, bandwidth, power constraints).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in GPU performance profiling and optimization workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with compute-based rendering techniques, GPU-driven pipelines, and modern culling/visibility approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with UE5’s Nanite/Lumen or equivalent advanced rendering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in custom engine development or low-level rendering systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributions to open-source graphics tools or technical publications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-platform rendering experience beyond mobile (PC/console).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact ----- Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re the world&#39;s leading consumer healthcare platform, supporting millions of patients across the US, Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan, Spain and Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re driven by the belief that good health should last a lifetime, and that to get there we need to deliver the personalised, high quality and empathetic care that the traditional system cannot support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with our care teams of prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists and dietitians to support patients across preventative health, weight management and specific women&#39;s and men&#39;s health conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We joined Hims &amp;amp; Hers so that you can do all of the above on a bigger scale, with more ambition, a stronger global brand and the resources to deliver care to patients in dozens of countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who appreciate and are excited by the enormity and uniqueness of this challenge, and want to work in the most ambitious, smart, fast moving and positive sum environment of their lives to transform how healthcare is delivered globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope that&#39;s you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;142&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;145&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;307&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a sharp, commercially-minded finance leader to own our Germany Expansion Market&#39;s financial strategy and lay the foundations for European expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;593&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll act as the central voice on performance, forecasting, and financial decision-making. From CAC and contribution margin to free cash flow and scenario planning, you’ll be responsible for turning financial insight into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;595&quot; data-end=&quot;877&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with cross-functional leaders across growth, operations, product, and care to shape the our Germany and AMEA Expansion Market&#39;s financial trajectory, while ensuring the business runs efficiently and invests wisely. This is a high-trust, high-impact role where the stakes, and the pace, are high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;While this role is DE and Expansion market focused today, it has clear runway to grow into a broader European leadership role as we expand across new markets and business lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Responsible For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1113&quot;&gt;Own the Germany and AMEA Expansion Market financial model&lt;/strong&gt; — Build and manage end-to-end models for revenue, CAC, LTV, margin, and free cash flow. Your outputs will guide day-to-day decisions and long-term bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1410&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1298&quot;&gt;Lead the planning process&lt;/strong&gt; — Drive monthly re-forecasting, annual planning, and scenario modelling in close collaboration with Group FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Be the commercial partner to growth and ops&lt;/strong&gt; — Set CAC and payback targets, assess performance by cohort, and guide spend allocation to maximise ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Run commercial analysis that unlocks growth&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead deep dives into pricing, retention, margin, and expansion levers to identify opportunities and recommend trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Make the numbers visible&lt;/strong&gt; — Build dashboards and trackers for key DE performance metrics (e.g. contribution margin, CAC, LTV, cash flow), keeping the business tightly aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Ensure clean, accurate financial operations&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with Group Finance on reconciliations, cost allocation, and timely month-end closes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;Build for scale&lt;/strong&gt; — Design financial systems and insights that don’t just serve the German markets, but become the blueprint for future markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;6+ years in strategic finance&lt;/strong&gt;, FP&amp;amp;A, consulting, or banking, with experience in high-growth or tech-enabled businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2384&quot; data-end=&quot;2521&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2409&quot; data-end=&quot;2450&quot;&gt;P&amp;amp;L and end-to-end planning processes&lt;/strong&gt; — ideally in a business with both consumer and operational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
